  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A square oil painting of a village of pastel capped towers with small horned creatures, and a large teal creature with a horn at upper right, signed crump 11.",
    "description": "A square oil painting on wood, signed crump 11 at lower right. A village of rounded towers with flat caps and tall windows in pink, teal, purple and yellow sits on a green hill under a pale blue sky. Small horned creatures with single eyes in orange, blue and pink sit among the towers, and a large teal creature with a purple horn and a wide smile looms at upper right. A large pink creature's head enters at lower left. Thick black outlines, flat colour.",
    "impression": "A village where the inhabitants come in all sizes, from the pocket sized to the one that could sit on the town. The big teal creature looks benevolent, like a guardian. Soft and sunny, with a sense that nothing bad happens here.",
